# Encounter overrides for the Ebon Hawk's turret (our own data, see
# crates/session/src/encounters.rs; never written into the game install).
#
# Every space fight loads this module (docs/MINIGAMES.md). In
# co-op each seat mans a gun, and each gunner past the first adds
# half again of every Sith fighter's hit points (sim::minigame's
# Rules::per_player_hp); the module places no hostile creature.
per_player hp x0.5
